sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant K as Kassa (Click / Payme / Uzum / P2P)
    participant API as API (hooks.settle)
    participant R as risk.verdict
    participant DB as Postgres
    actor A as Admin
    participant W as Worker

    K->>API: Payment confirmed
    API->>R: verdict(payment)
    R->>DB: pg_advisory_xact_lock(user), sums in a savepoint
    alt trusted, or within the limits
        R-->>API: pass
        API->>DB: credit top-up / mark_paid (NOTIFY orders)
        API-->>K: success
    else over kassa or user limit, or the check failed
        R-->>API: hold (kassa_limit / user_limit / check_failed)
        API->>DB: attempt succeeded, owner held, payment_holds row
        API-->>K: success (nothing credited, nothing bought)
        Note over DB: gauge csmarket_payment_holds_open, alert PaymentHeldForReview
    end

    alt Admin releases
        A->>API: POST /admin/payments/holds/{id}/release
        API->>DB: credit_topup / mark_paid, hold released
        API->>W: NOTIFY orders (order)
    else Admin returned the money in the cabinet
        A->>API: POST /admin/payments/holds/{id}/returned
        API->>DB: attempt refunded, top-up rejected / order cancelled, hold returned
    else Kassa cancels the held payment itself
        K->>API: Cancel / reverse
        API->>DB: attempt refunded, top-up reversed (no debit) / order cancelled, hold reversed_by_kassa
    end
